rease beside the mouth when smiling. Usually dressed in a soft blue checked shirt with a narrow brass watch set a little fast, Wynn gathers both sleeves neatly before settling in when listening.","personality":"Wynn gets protective of anybody who comes into a meeting unprepared. Wynn privately wishes people would notice the amount of preparation behind this apparent ease.","agenda":"To try the classmate's line before judging it.","family":"Parker Parker is Wynn’s parent’s cousin. Wynn checks the date twice. Parker brings something that can still be enjoyed tomorrow. Arrangements do change in their family. Taking a delay seriously without treating it as an insult took both of them years. Asked about *The return of a witness*, Parker says, “I invited her for lunch and didn't tell her who would be at the table.”","connections":"Edward Roy. The classmate trying the line hears how a chosen name ought to sound aloud.","familyIds":["AH-R1394"],"connectionIds":["AH-R0965"],"reactions":[{"situation":"A grandparent tries to correct a word in front of classmates","response":"Wynn asks the grandparent to save the correction until the pupil asks for it.","asWritten":"A grandparent tries to correct a word in front of classmates. Wynn asks the grandparent to save the correction until the pupil asks for it."},{"situation":"A friend asks for a loan due back before payday","response":"Wynn agrees on a sum and a date with the friend in private, keeping the arrangement out of family gossip.","asWritten":"A friend asks for a loan due back before payday. Wynn agrees on a sum and a date with the friend in private, keeping the arrangement out of family gossip."},{"situation":"If a colleague lies to save face","response":"Wynn offers one private chance to correct it before the next conversation.","asWritten":"If a colleague lies to save face, Wynn offers one private chance to correct it before the next conversation."}]},"appearanceSource":"biography casting design"}},{"mesh":6,"name":"Hair_